"title": "images.chicagohistory.org", "url": "https://images.chicagohistory.org/asset/145886/"}]}, "I ran one search, which covered only the fireboat half of your query. I did not search for the Illinois statehood date (December 3, 1818), so I have nothing on that.\n\n**Fireboat:** The Illinois was a Chicago Fire Department fireboat. Wikipedia says it was commissioned in 1888 and was one of the first fireboats with a steel hull. A fleet table on the same site gives 1899 as the build year, so the sources disagree on that date. In 1908 it was hit by falling debris while fighting a large fire and sank in about 20 feet of water in the Chicago River. It was quickly refloated and returned to service. An August 1908 newspaper account describes the sinking as caused by the collapse of an elevator wall during the fire at the Burlington railroad dock, with several firemen slightly injured and the crew rescued."], "durationSeconds": 5.752164374999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01E1onQS91MmUXaNRJSFcVYE", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXawu3Zxje9DoUfX4qF", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:** 这艘消防船是\"Illinois\"号,同名的伊利诺伊州于 1818 年 12 月 3 日加入联邦,成为第 21 个州。\n\n- **消防船:** 1908 年,芝加哥消防局的 Illinois 号在芝加哥河上被倒塌的碎片砸中,沉没在约 20 英尺深的水里,随后很快被打捞浮起,重新服役。1908 年 8 月的报纸报道也说,Burlington 铁路码头大火中粮仓墙体倒塌,压沉了这艘船。\n- **建成年份:** 各来源不一致。Wikipedia 的 Illinois 词条写 1888 年,\"Fireboats of Chicago\" 的船队表写 1899 年。这不影响答案。\n- **未核实的部分:** 1818 年 12 月 3 日这个建州日期,我两次搜索都没查到来源,是凭已有知识给出的,没有网址可引。\n\nSources:\n- [Illinois (fireboat) – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_(fireboat))\n- [Fireboats of Chicago – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fireboats_of_Chicago)\n- [Valentine Democrat, Aug. 13, 1908](https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/sn95069780/1908-08-13/ed-1/seq-7/ocr)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1169, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5455, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1169}, "output_tokens": 504, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:58:10.673Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXawdSC8jGrwRseG1q7"}
